          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Nighttime observation of several lights arranged in a circle and spinning, then moving abruptly from right to left: probable observation of light displays produced by event lighting projectors called \"skytracers\" or \"sky rose\".",
          "translation_text_sha256": "3b911466179b9ff0265d9135e5487d8b29d71ce6ec2ffa8eecf2019fb4ea54b5"
        },
        {
